        "@value": "by substituting for the words “a member of the Fund” before the words “who is not a Malaysian citizen” the words “an employee”; and"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/8/eng@/~cl_4__para_a__subpara_ii",
