        "@value": "in subsection (3), by substituting for the words “a member of the Fund” the words “an employee”. Amendment of section 70d"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/8/eng@/~cl_5",
